window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p>Cass Saélihn isn't some defenseless damsel sitting on her ass and waiting for her hot, alpha males to rescue her.</p> <p>She won't accept the fate of being in another cage. Even though the torque on her neck binds her, rendering her powerless.</p> <p>She won't allow Ares and Apollo to sever her mating bond to her beloved mates, no matter how they seduce, threaten, or torture her. </p> <p>She doesn't bend, and she'll never break.They may have a terrible plan for her, but she's reserved worse for them.</p> <p>Now she awaits the one chance to strike back and return to her mates, who she knows are coming for her.</p> <p>Warning: This is a full-length reverse harem fantasy/paranormal romance that features one hell of strong woman and her four powerful supernatural mates. It contains brutal battles, explicit love scenes, raw language, magic, swordfights, Greek gods, dark fae, vampires, shifters, and a lot of a--holes.</p>"; 
